  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DANCHURCHAID IMPREST 17 24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant  to Danchurchaid Cambodia and local partners has been designed to support the protection of land rights and continued access to natural resources for 28,372 people (13,599 women) in 10 provinces in Cambodia. The project targets the most vulnerable communities in these provinces including disadvantaged indigenous people, minority groups, and communities that are affected by land grabs. The project also supports target communities strengthen their knowledge and practice on sustainable and climate smart use of natural resources to improve their livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
